<section class="s-actions" style="max-width:1180px;margin:24px auto 0"><div class="s-actions-head"><div><span class="kicker">Scope 1 · 2 · 3</span><h2>Beregn karbonmåling</h2><p>Aktivitet × utslippsfaktor gir en sporbar foreløpig verdi. Kvalitetssikring kreves før rapportering.</p></div><span class="hitl-badge">HITL · påkrevd</span></div><form data-s-action="calculate_carbon" style="margin-top:16px;display:grid;gap:9px"><label>Aktivitet<input name="title" maxlength="240" required placeholder="Elektrisitet · lokasjon Oslo" /></label><div class="form-row"><label>Scope<select name="scope"><option value="scope_1">Scope 1</option><option value="scope_2">Scope 2</option><option value="scope_3">Scope 3</option></select></label><label>Enhet<input name="valueUnit" maxlength="30" value="kg CO₂e" required /></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Mengde<input name="activityNumeric" type="number" min="0" step="0.001" required placeholder="1000" /></label><label>Faktor<input name="emissionFactor" type="number" min="0" step="0.000001" required placeholder="0.12" /></label></div><button type="submit">Beregn og registrer</button></form></section>
<style>.s-actions{padding:24px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:18px;background:#f1f7ed}.s-actions-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}.s-actions-head h2{margin:9px 0 7px;font:500 1.8rem Georgia,serif}.s-actions-head p{margin:0;color:#63736a;font:.78rem/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.kicker{font:700 .68rem system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#477c51}.hitl-badge{height:max-content;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#dff2d2;color:#3f764c;font:700 .62rem system-ui,sans-serif}form{padding:15px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:13px;background:#fff}label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;color:#718078;font:600 .62rem system-ui,sans-serif}input,select{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:8px;border:1px solid #10241f26;border-radius:8px;background:#fbfdfb;font:.71rem system-ui,sans-serif}.form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px}button{padding:10px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#477c51;color:#fff;font:700 .67rem system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:800px){.s-actions{margin-left:15px!important;margin-right:15px!important}.s-actions-head{flex-direction:column}.form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
